"`request[\"cart\"][\"parts\"][<id>][\"format\"]`: the format of the "
"binary (e.g. `\"step\"`)"
msgstr ""
"`request[\"cart\"][\"parts\"][<id>][\"format\"]`: das Format der "
"Binärdaten (z. B. `\"step\"`)"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1148
